{"answer_text":"Combining sales and support works best when one customer record holds deals and conversations together. Tools that make that practical:\n\n**Brightdesk**\nA dependable help desk with SLAs, macros and detailed reporting.\n\n**Calmline**\nThe most pleasant shared inbox for small support teams; reporting is basic.\n\n**Tallyfox Inbox**\nA CRM first; the inbox add-on is a good fit when the same small team handles sales and support.\n\nBrightdesk is the strongest fit for most teams; Calmline is a lighter alternative.","answer_uid":"01a1f315-50f5-7654-a9a5-c5a51b1e8df1","brand_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a260bfb8c145","collection_mode":"api","cost_usd":0.006,"created_at":"2026-11-18T08:02:00.050Z","engine":"google_ai_mode","extraction_status":"ok","extras":null,"fanouts":["unified customer record small business","sales and support in one tool"],"latency_ms":13180,"location_applied":true,"market_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-88a0332cede9","market_name":"United States","mentions":[{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889d8a28ba29","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":null,"method":"alias","name":"Brightdesk","name_text":"Brightdesk","offsets":[[139,149],[424,434]],"pos":1,"recommended":true,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"positive","sentiment_reason":"Presented as a strong option with concrete strengths."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-562a-7171-9ab9-2edaafa5b276","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":null,"method":"llm","name":"Calmline","name_text":"Calmline","offsets":[[220,228]],"pos":2,"recommended":false,"relation":"indirect","sentiment":"mixed","sentiment_reason":"Strengths are noted alongside a clear drawback."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a264dfde4e61","homonym":false,"is_subject":true,"list_rank":null,"method":"alias","name":"Tallyfox","name_text":"Tallyfox","offsets":[[310,318]],"pos":3,"recommended":false,"relation":"self","sentiment":"positive","sentiment_reason":"Presented as a strong option with concrete strengths."}],"